# --- secret shapes (added 2026-08-24 after R455) ---------------------------------
# A live USPTO API key reached a PUBLIC repo because .uspto_key was documented as
# "gitignored" and never actually added to any .gitignore. .env* was covered here;
# nothing else was. These patterns are about SHAPE, not about the one file that
# leaked: the next secret will have a name nobody predicted.
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
*_key
.*_key
credentials*
*secret*
*.token
token.txt
